{"version": "https://jsonfeed.org/version/1", "title": "MiSTer FPGA Documentation (fork with editorial improvements)", "home_page_url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/", "feed_url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/feed_json_updated.json", "description": "MiSTer FPGA is an open source project that aims to recreate various classic computers, game consoles, and arcade machines, using modern hardware.", "icon": "assets/mister_kun_bw.svg", "authors": [{"name": "Kevin Coleman"}], "language": "en", "items": [{"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/computer/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/computer/", "title": "Computer Core Networking", "content_html": "<h1>Computer core Internet and console connections</h1>\n<p>Since the May 7, 2018 release, MiSTer supports a serial (UART) connection from FPGA to Linux. Linux runs a ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/computer.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/lag/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/lag/", "title": "Lag Explained", "content_html": "<p>A common concern among retro enthusiasts is whether a device like MiSTer has <em>lag</em> and whether it creates a less desirable experience than original hardware....</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/lag.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/videoscaling/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/videoscaling/", "title": "Video Scaling", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer has a built-in scaler that converts the cores' low-resolution video to a higher resolution, optionally using filters to improve the picture on modern ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/videoscaling.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/input/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/input/", "title": "Controllers", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer supports a wide variety of input devices. It also offers options for configuring them and several quality-of-life features that work in most (sometime...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/input.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/psx/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/psx/", "title": "PSX", "content_html": "<p>The Sony PlayStation (PSX) MiSTer core is the most feature-filled and heavily developed core so far:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Multiple controller options</li>\n<li>Automatic BIOS region s...</li>\n</ul>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/psx.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/component/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/component/", "title": "Core Component and Feature Usage", "content_html": "<p>This is a list of many recreated components used in various MiSTer FPGA cores. It is a manually maintained snapshot, not an exhaustive inventory.</p>\n<h2>AMP</h2>\n<h2>...</h2>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/component.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/emu/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/emu/", "title": "emu Module Overview", "content_html": "<p>On MiSTer, the top level is inside <a href=\"https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/Template_MiSTer/blob/master/sys/sys_top.v\">sys/sys_top.v</a>{target=_blank}. When writing or...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/emu.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/mra/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/mra/", "title": "Arcade ROMs and MRA Files", "content_html": "<p>This page explains most of the intricacies of the way MiSTer handles ROMs for Arcade systems.</p>\n<h2>MRA Format</h2>\n<p>Because some arcade boards can change games by ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/mra.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/computer/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/computer/", "title": "\u30b3\u30f3\u30d4\u30e5\u30fc\u30bf\u30fc\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u30ef\u30fc\u30af", "content_html": "<h1>\u30b3\u30f3\u30d4\u30e5\u30fc\u30bf\u30fc\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u30a4\u30f3\u30bf\u30fc\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u30fb\u30b3\u30f3\u30bd\u30fc\u30eb\u63a5\u7d9a</h1>\n<p>2018\u5e745\u67087\u65e5\u306e\u30ea\u30ea\u30fc\u30b9\u4ee5\u964d\u3001MiSTer \u306f FPGA \u304b\u3089 Linux \u3078\u306e\u30b7\u30ea\u30a2\u30eb\uff08UART\uff09\u63a5\u7d9a\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002Linux \u306f\u3053\u306e\u63a5\u7d9a\u4e0a\u3067 PPP \u307e\u305f\u306f\u30b3\u30f3\u30bd\u30fc\u30eb\u30c7\u30fc\u30e2\u30f3\u3092\u52d5\u304b\u3057\u3001FPGA \u30b3\u30a2\u304b\u3089\u30a4\u30f3\u30bf\u30fc\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u3084 Linux \u30b7\u30a7\u30eb\u3078\u30a2\u30af...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/computer.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/lag/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/lag/", "title": "\u30e9\u30b0\u306e\u89e3\u8aac", "content_html": "<p>\u30ec\u30c8\u30ed\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u611b\u597d\u5bb6\u306e\u9593\u3067\u3088\u304f\u3042\u308b\u61f8\u5ff5\u306f\u3001MiSTer \u306e\u3088\u3046\u306a\u6a5f\u5668\u306b_\u30e9\u30b0_\u304c\u3042\u308b\u304b\u3069\u3046\u304b\u3001\u305d\u3057\u3066\u5b9f\u6a5f\u3088\u308a\u4f53\u9a13\u304c\u52a3\u308b\u304b\u3069\u3046\u304b\u3067\u3059\u3002</p>\n<p>\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306e\u96fb\u5b50\u6a5f\u5668\u306b\u306f\u4f55\u3089\u304b\u306e_\u30ec\u30a4\u30c6\u30f3\u30b7\u30fc_\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001\u554f\u984c\u306b\u306a\u308b\u306e\u306f\u305d\u306e\u30ec\u30a4\u30c6\u30f3\u30b7\u30fc\u304c\u30d5\u30ec\u30fc\u30e0\u306e\u53d6\u308a\u3053\u307c\u3057\u3092\u5f15\u304d\u8d77\u3053\u3059\u5834\u5408\u3060\u3051\u3067\u3059\u30021\u30d5\u30ec\u30fc\u30e0\u306f\u901a\u5e38\u300160 \u30d5\u30ec\u30fc\u30e0\u6bce\u79d2\uff0860 ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/lag.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/videoscaling/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/videoscaling/", "title": "\u30d3\u30c7\u30aa\u30b9\u30b1\u30fc\u30ea\u30f3\u30b0", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306b\u306f\u5185\u8535\u30b9\u30b1\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc\u304c\u3042\u308a\u3001\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u4f4e\u89e3\u50cf\u5ea6\u6620\u50cf\u3092\u9ad8\u89e3\u50cf\u5ea6\u306b\u5909\u63db\u3057\u3001\u30aa\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3067\u30d5\u30a3\u30eb\u30bf\u30fc\u3092\u4f7f\u3063\u3066\u30e2\u30c0\u30f3\u30c7\u30a3\u30b9\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u3067\u306e\u898b\u6804\u3048\u3092\u6539\u5584\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3067\u306f\u30b9\u30b1\u30fc\u30ea\u30f3\u30b0\u30aa\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u306e\u8a2d\u5b9a\u65b9\u6cd5\u3092\u8aac\u660e\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>Video Scale Mode\uff08vscale_mode\uff09</h2>\n<p>microSD \u30ab\u30fc\u30c9\u76f4\u4e0b\u306e [...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/videoscaling.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/input/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/input/", "title": "\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306f\u591a\u7a2e\u591a\u69d8\u306a\u5165\u529b\u6a5f\u5668\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u3001\u8a2d\u5b9a\u30aa\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3084\u3001\u307b\u3068\u3093\u3069\u306e\uff08\u5834\u5408\u306b\u3088\u3063\u3066\u306f\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306e\uff09\u30b3\u30a2\u3067\u4f7f\u3048\u308b\u4fbf\u5229\u6a5f\u80fd\u3082\u5099\u3048\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3067\u306f\u30b9\u30d4\u30ca\u30fc\u30fb\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u30d1\u30c3\u30c9\u30fb\u30b8\u30e7\u30a4\u30b9\u30c6\u30a3\u30c3\u30af\u30fb\u30ad\u30fc\u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u306a\u3069\u306e\u6a5f\u5668\u306e\u7279\u6b8a\u306a\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3092\u8aac\u660e\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u3069\u3093\u306a\u6a5f\u5668\u304c\u4f7f\u3048\u308b\uff1f</h2>\n<p>\u57fa\u672c\u7684\u306b\u3001\u901a\u5e38\u306e USB HID \u4e92\u63db\u5165\u529b\u6a5f...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/input.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/psx/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/psx/", "title": "PSX", "content_html": "<p>Sony PlayStation\uff08PSX\uff09\u306e MiSTer \u30b3\u30a2\u306f\u3001\u3053\u308c\u307e\u3067\u3067\u6700\u3082\u6a5f\u80fd\u304c\u5145\u5b9f\u3057\u3001\u958b\u767a\u3082\u6d3b\u767a\u306a\u30b3\u30a2\u3067\u3059\uff1a</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\u8c4a\u5bcc\u306a\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc\u30aa\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3</li>\n<li>BIOS \u30ea\u30fc\u30b8\u30e7\u30f3\u306e\u81ea\u52d5\u5207\u308a\u66ff\u3048</li>\n<li>\u624b\u52d5\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u8aad\u307f\u8fbc\u307f\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u305f\u30e1\u30e2\u30ea\u30fc\u30ab\u30fc\u30c92\u30b9\u30ed\u30c3\u30c8</li>\n<li>\u9ad8\u901f\u5316\u30e2\u30fc\u30c9</li>\n<li>\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u5185\u30c6\u30af\u30b9\u30c1\u30e3\u5909\u66f4</li>\n</ul>\n<p>PSX ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/psx.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/component/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/component/", "title": "\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u30b3\u30f3\u30dd\u30fc\u30cd\u30f3\u30c8\u5bfe\u5fdc\u8868", "content_html": "<p>\u3053\u308c\u306f\u3055\u307e\u3056\u307e\u306a MiSTer FPGA \u30b3\u30a2\u3067\u4f7f\u308f\u308c\u308b\u518d\u73fe\u30b3\u30f3\u30dd\u30fc\u30cd\u30f3\u30c8\u306e\u4e00\u89a7\u3067\u3059\u3002 \u624b\u52d5\u30e1\u30f3\u30c6\u30ca\u30f3\u30b9\u306e\u30b9\u30ca\u30c3\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8\u3067\u3042\u308a\u3001\u7db2\u7f85\u7684\u306a\u76ee\u9332\u3067\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002</p>\n<h2>AMP</h2>\n<h3>IR3R60N Audio</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>[Gameboy Advance](https://github.com/MiSTer-dev...</li>\n</ul>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/component.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/emu/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/emu/", "title": "emu\u30e2\u30b8\u30e5\u30fc\u30eb\u6982\u8981", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u3067\u306f\u3001\u30c8\u30c3\u30d7\u30ec\u30d9\u30eb\u306f <a href=\"https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/Template_MiSTer/blob/master/sys/sys_top.v\">sys/sys_top.v</a>{target=_blank} \u5185\u306b\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002MiSTer \u30b3\u30a2\u3092\u66f8\u304f\u30fb\u79fb\u690d\u3059\u308b\u3068\u304d\u3001Quartu...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/emu.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/mra/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/mra/", "title": "\u30a2\u30fc\u30b1\u30fc\u30c9ROM\u3068MRA\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb", "content_html": "<p>\u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3067\u306f\u3001MiSTer \u304c\u30a2\u30fc\u30b1\u30fc\u30c9\u30b7\u30b9\u30c6\u30e0\u306e ROM \u3092\u6271\u3046\u65b9\u6cd5\u306e\u8907\u96d1\u306a\u90e8\u5206\u306e\u307b\u3068\u3093\u3069\u3092\u8aac\u660e\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>MRA \u30d5\u30a9\u30fc\u30de\u30c3\u30c8</h2>\n<p>\u4e00\u90e8\u306e\u30a2\u30fc\u30b1\u30fc\u30c9\u57fa\u677f\u306f\u65b0\u3057\u3044 ROM \u3092\u633f\u3059\u3060\u3051\u3067\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3092\u5909\u3048\u3089\u308c\u308b\u305f\u3081\u3001RBF \u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u3092\u30e1\u30cb\u30e5\u30fc\u30ea\u30b9\u30c8\u304b\u3089\u5916\u3057\u3001\u4ee3\u308f\u308a\u306b MRA \u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u3092\u30d6\u30e9\u30a6\u30ba\u3059\u308b\u306e\u304c\u7406\u306b\u304b\u306a\u3063\u3066...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/mra.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:17:24+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/addons/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/addons/", "title": "Add-on Boards", "content_html": "<figure markdown>\n  ![MiSTer FPGA Sandwich Punk Style Art by hewhoisred](img/misterpunk.png){ align=center width=\"400\" }\n  <figcaption>Artwork by Hewhoisred<...", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/addons.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:10:04+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/cd/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/cd/", "title": "CD-based ROMs", "content_html": "<p>CD image format support depends on the core. CUE/BIN and CHD are common, but some cores also accept ISO or other formats. Check the core's readme for the sup...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/cd.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:10:04+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/faq/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/faq/", "title": "FAQ", "content_html": "<p>Answers to frequently asked questions about MiSTer. If something is missing, feel free to contribute by editing this page on GitHub with the Edit (pen) icon ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/faq.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:10:04+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/hotkey/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/hotkey/", "title": "Hotkeys", "content_html": "<p>This page lists the MiSTer hotkeys. Hotkeys save time, and some actions can only be done with a keyboard or gamepad hotkey. Some hotkeys work only in the Mai...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/hotkey.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:10:04+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}]}